OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners say under-threat clock
OL,4,Acould be saved
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners fighting to save a
OL,7,F73-year-old heritage floral clock in
OL,8,FEast Sussex say it could be restored,
OL,9,Fdespite the council saying it is beyond
OL,10,Frepair.
OL,12,FPlans by Brighton & Hove City Council
OL,13,Fto remove the floral clock in Palmeira
OL,14,FSquare, Hove, prompted opposition and a
OL,15,Fpetition signed by over 3,000 people.
OL,17,FFriends of Hove Floral Clock, which has
OL,18,Fapplied to Historic England for Grade
OL,19,FII listed status, want the council to
OL,20,Fpause replacement plans until that
OL,21,Fapplication has been determined.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
