OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners say under-threat clock
OL,4,Acould be saved
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigner Sarah Ratty said: "This is a
OL,7,Fwonderful opportunity to turn a moment
OL,8,Fof uncertainty into a lasting legacy
OL,9,Ffor Hove."
